WEBVTT

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.226
This approach is changing
what was once considered impossible

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.292
into something actively possible today.

00:03:07.625 --> 00:03:09.643
Take SpaceX,

00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:11.809
a deep tech pioneer

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:15.018
who disrupted the aerospace industry

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:19.268
by producing reusable
rockets and spaceships,

00:03:19.292 --> 00:03:23.583
reducing the cost of going to space
by a factor of 10.

00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:28.643
They achieved this by combining
advanced materials

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:32.226
and chemicals developed
in the last 20 years